          }
          comment {
            value: "There are examples where a medication request may include the option of an oral dose or an Intravenous or Intramuscular dose.  For example, \"Ondansetron 8mg orally or IV twice a day as needed for nausea\" or \"Compazine\302\256 (prochlorperazine) 5-10mg PO or 25mg PR bid prn nausea or vomiting\".  In these cases, two medication requests would be created that could be grouped together.  The decision on which dose and route of administration to use is based on the patient\'s condition at the time the dose is needed."
